      "versionNonce": 128530309,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792767084144,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A barrier is a place in the program.\n2 calls = 2 different barriers.\n\nEvery barrier waits for ALL threads in a block, not\njust the ones that came.\n\nThe missing threads are alive, but stuck at the other barrier,\nwaiting back.\n\nFix: Branch only if the whole block takes the same side or\nput the barrier out the if-else statement.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A barrier is a place in the program.\n2 calls = 2 different barriers.\n\nEvery barrier waits for ALL threads in a block, not\njust the ones that came.\n\nThe missing threads are alive, but stuck at the other barrier,\nwaiting back.\n\nFix: Branch only if the whole block takes the same side or\nput the barrier out the if-else statement.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
